    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galactic Coffee Shop is a sci fi incremental game where you build a coffee enterprise from a humble coffee stand to a star stretching empire. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your coffee creation capacities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce unrealized amounts of coffee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach new markets to sell more and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand through space and beyond</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692320/extras/8fb9cd5671945cef7033f03495a294d3.poster.avif?t=1748571288\" width=660 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692320/extras/8fb9cd5671945cef7033f03495a294d3.webm?t=1748571288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692320/extras/8fb9cd5671945cef7033f03495a294d3.mp4?t=1748571288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow through the stages of coffee production, your role at the head of a coffee empire changes, and you reach higher levels of management. Move on from personally making the coffee to accumulating employees. At each new stage of coffee domination comes more means to expand even further!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galactic Coffee Shop is a sci fi incremental game where you build a coffee enterprise from a humble coffee stand to a star stretching empire. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your coffee creation capacities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce unrealized amounts of coffee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach new markets to sell more and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand through space and beyond</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692320/extras/8fb9cd5671945cef7033f03495a294d3.poster.avif?t=1748571288\" width=660 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692320/extras/8fb9cd5671945cef7033f03495a294d3.webm?t=1748571288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692320/extras/8fb9cd5671945cef7033f03495a294d3.mp4?t=1748571288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow through the stages of coffee production, your role at the head of a coffee empire changes, and you reach higher levels of management. Move on from personally making the coffee to accumulating employees. At each new stage of coffee domination comes more means to expand even further!</p>",
    "short_description": "Grow your coffee enterprise from a single stand to an empire stretching across the stars! Go from grinding beans to hiring employees to buying buildings to consuming planets! Bring the gift of coffee to the stars!",
